# The native build outputs. None of it belongs in an image — the web image builds from the
# workspace sources only, and the engine image (engine/docker/Dockerfile) compiles its own
# binaries for its own Linux. All are gitignored, so CI's fresh checkout never has them; this is what stops a LOCAL
# image build from shipping ~30GB of CMake output and Electron packages to the daemon as build
# context.
engine/st0-engine/build
engine/st0-supervisor/build
engine/st0-tray/out
engine/st0-tray/.cache
engine/st0-tray/staging
